      "content": "`terminalPositionChangeId` is optional in the exported reconciliation type, and `applyPreparedChange` still accepts a Closed reconciliation that omits it. In that case `terminalId` is undefined and the new Close Reason falls back to the literal `candidate:pc-1` below, even though that Position Change has been assigned a durable ID. This persists a dangling reference (previously the local sort supplied a durable ID). Require and validate a terminal Position Change ID when adding a Close Reason, returning `ReconciliationMismatch` if it is absent, rather than staging the temporary reference.",
